.DS_Store
# Local full-project archive snapshots — never commit these
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
# Workspace-mirror visibility: the snapshot walker ignores everything above,
# so the codogma-engine-*.zip / *.tar.gz archives in the repo root are
# re-included here to stay visible in the synced workspace view. They are
# still never staged or committed (a pre-commit hook blocks it as well).
!codogma-engine-*.zip
!codogma-engine-*.tar.gz
dev.log
node_modules/
tool-results/
.idea/
worklog.md
**/dist/
/.env
